  "status_text": "Eight messages can hide behind the same tallies on a ring of lights. Count pairs and the message comes out. Lean checked this on a ring of 60 lights with alternating red and blue links. Pin 18 lights to encode three bits. A link mismatches when its two lights differ. For each total mismatch count, both the number of completions and their summed red mismatches agree across all eight messages. Tallying pairs of red mismatches within each completion gives the counts that recover the three bits (L-pcx-400).",
